--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9c94e8900bdbef942ad19f626cdac685, type: 3}
  m_Name: Horizontal_Scene0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sceneHeader: Prologue
  sceneSubHeader: A Touch of Glucose
  NarrationBeats:
  - narrationText: 'Our story takes place in the islets of Langerhans, a region of
      your pancreas.  '
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -95495987
        Data2: 1126949860
        Data3: 535855246
        Data4: 345450033
      Path: event:/VO/scene_00_01
  - narrationText: "Here live pancreatic beta cells, the only cell type in your body
      that can produce and secrete insulin, a vital hormone that helps manage your
      body\u2019s blood sugar levels.\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 673730214
        Data2: 1118427311
        Data3: 2081374880
        Data4: 1865355047
      Path: event:/VO/scene_00_02
  - narrationText: "The presence of glucose naturally stimulates these cells to release
      some of its insulin.\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1916551472
        Data2: 1313214723
        Data3: 1899124910
        Data4: -799721218
      Path: event:/VO/scene_00_03
  - narrationText: "Glucose molecules reach these cells via your bloodstream. \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -608643259
        Data2: 1313488381
        Data3: -721392765
        Data4: 94566656
      Path: event:/VO/scene_00_04
  - narrationText: "Once they\u2019re nearby, a pancreatic beta cell will absorb
      these molecules with transporter proteins on its membrane called GLUT.\r \r\r\r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: 907809611
        Data2: 1149783753
        Data3: -822716509
        Data4: -1349726974
      Path: event:/VO/scene_00_05
  - narrationText: "Managing the blood sugar in your body is important. \r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -905226407
        Data2: 1276857140
        Data3: -416646211
        Data4: 2022162092
      Path: event:/VO/scene_00_06
  - narrationText: "It helps your cells fuel themselves and also prevents damage
      within your body that can happen from too much sugar in your blood.\r \r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1248976665
        Data2: 1150055410
        Data3: 1672304018
        Data4: -2107527166
      Path: event:/VO/scene_00_07
  - narrationText: "So what happens when your bloodstream is flooded with more sugar,
      like after a major meal?\r\r \r"
    narrationTrack:
      Guid:
        Data1: -592117129
        Data2: 1120281523
        Data3: -706051943
        Data4: -2080822594
      Path: event:/VO/scene_00_08
